sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Interior Designer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>EnquiryDetailPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ViewEnquiryDetailBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ViewEnquiryDetailController
  participant Enquiry as «entity»<br/>Enquiry
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: open an enquiry with the customer's contact details
  UI->>B: GET /api/designer/enquiries/{id} (JWT)
  B->>C: view(Integer designerId, Integer enquiryId)
  C->>Enquiry: findById()
  Enquiry->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Enquiry: rows
  Enquiry-->>C: result
  C->>Enquiry: changeStatus()
  Enquiry->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Enquiry: rows
  Enquiry-->>C: result
  C-->>B: EnquiryDetail
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result